{"seq":1,"slug":"anycast-model-catchment-ecmp","title":"Anycast 地址模型、catchment 与 ECMP 边缘分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/bgp-interdomain-routing-anycast-peering-edge-traffic-engineering/anycast-traffic-engineering/anycast-model-catchment-ecmp","wordCount":2949,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"anycast-地址模型-catchment-与-ecmp-边缘分布\">Anycast 地址模型、catchment 与 ECMP 边缘分布</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-一个地址-多个实例-控制面收敛到单跳\">核心概念：一个地址、多个实例、控制面收敛到单跳</h2><p>Anycast 的地址模型与单播截然不同：同一个 IP 前缀被多个物理站点（PoP、机房、边缘集群）<strong>同时宣告</strong>，转发面对同一目的地存在多条可用路径。用户发出的每个数据包，都会被沿途路由器按本地最优路径送去<strong>其中一个</strong>实例——而不是全部。这个模型把&quot;服务选点&quot;从应用层下沉到路由层：你不写调度代码，BGP 就是你的调度器。</p>\n<p>理解 Anycast 必须同时握住三条相互独立的机制链：<strong>宣告链</strong>（谁在向互联网说&quot;这个前缀在我这里&quot;，由 BGP UPDATE 承载，受路由策略、RPKI 起源验证（RFC 6480 体系）与上游过滤约束）；<strong>收敛链</strong>（路径选中哪条实例，由 BGP 决策过程 LOCAL_PREF → AS_PATH 长度 → MED → … 决定，时间尺度秒到分钟）；<strong>边缘分发链</strong>（流量到达站点边缘后，同一前缀下多个<strong>等价</strong>转发路径如何分流，即 <strong>ECMP</strong>，时间尺度是每一个数据包）。</p>\n<p>三条链里任何一条失调，都会产生用户可见的症状：宣告了但没人来（收敛问题）、来了但状态丢（会话问题）、或者同一个 TCP 连接的包被劈成两半（ECMP 哈希问题）。前两条链的细节见同 hub 的 <a href=\"prefix-announcement-dns-scheduling-method\">前缀宣告、DNS 与 Anycast 联合调度方法</a>；本文聚焦第三条链——catchment 有多大，以及边缘路由器内部的 ECMP 如何分布流量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  U[用户流 flows] --&gt; ISP[接入 ISP 与沿途 AS]&#10;  ISP --&gt;|BGP 最优路径| P1[PoP-A 边缘路由器]&#10;  ISP --&gt;|BGP 最优路径| P2[PoP-B 边缘路由器]&#10;  P1 --&gt; ECMP1{ECMP 哈希&lt;br/&gt;5 元组}&#10;  ECMP1 --&gt; S1[服务器组 A1]&#10;  ECMP1 --&gt; S2[服务器组 A2]&#10;  P2 --&gt; ECMP2{ECMP 哈希&lt;br/&gt;5 元组}&#10;  ECMP2 --&gt; S3[服务器组 B1]&#10;  ECMP2 --&gt; S4[服务器组 B2]&#10;  S1 -.-&gt;|同一任意播地址&lt;br/&gt;203.0.113.0/24| S4\">graph TD\n  U[用户流 flows] --&gt; ISP[接入 ISP 与沿途 AS]\n  ISP --&gt;|BGP 最优路径| P1[PoP-A 边缘路由器]\n  ISP --&gt;|BGP 最优路径| P2[PoP-B 边缘路由器]\n  P1 --&gt; ECMP1{ECMP 哈希&lt;br/&gt;5 元组}\n  ECMP1 --&gt; S1[服务器组 A1]\n  ECMP1 --&gt; S2[服务器组 A2]\n  P2 --&gt; ECMP2{ECMP 哈希&lt;br/&gt;5 元组}\n  ECMP2 --&gt; S3[服务器组 B1]\n  ECMP2 --&gt; S4[服务器组 B2]\n  S1 -.-&gt;|同一任意播地址&lt;br/&gt;203.0.113.0/24| S4</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>决策者</th>\n<th>决策粒度</th>\n<th>典型收敛时间</th>\n<th>失配症状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>控制面（DNS/ECS）</td>\n<td>权威 DNS</td>\n<td>一次解析</td>\n<td>TTL 级（数十秒–数百秒）</td>\n<td>DNS 指 A、包到 B</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>域间路由（BGP）</td>\n<td>沿途各 AS</td>\n<td>一个前缀（每包按转发表）</td>\n<td>秒–分钟</td>\n<td>黑洞、绕远路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>站内转发（ECMP）</td>\n<td>边缘路由器</td>\n<td>一个流（5 元组哈希）</td>\n<td>实时（无收敛）</td>\n<td>同流多径、乱序/丢会话</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"catchment-anycast-覆盖范围的量化与它的边界\">Catchment：Anycast 覆盖范围的量化与它的边界</h2><p><strong>Catchment（覆盖域）</strong> 是 Anycast 工程里最核心的度量：一个实例从互联网的哪些源地址集合中接走了流量。它不是地图上的圆——它由 BGP 拓扑决定，形状像被 AS 边界、IXP 交换点、私有互联（PNI）和路由策略共同切割出的多边形。测 catchment 的标准做法是从全球分布的探测点（如 RIPE Atlas）向 Anycast 地址发探针，看回包落在哪个实例（通常靠实例标识或 traceroute 末跳区分）。</p>\n<p>catchment 的大小由三个变量决定：<strong>on-net presence</strong>（承载流量的 AS 能否从自己网络内部看到你的宣告——Cloudflare、Google 这类运营商把节点直接放进大量 IXP 和 ISP 网内，本质就是扩大 catchment）、<strong>宣告的竞争力</strong>（同一站相对其他站，AS_PATH 越短越能多接一段源地址，这解释了同一地址在不同大陆的 catchment 极不对称）、<strong>互联多样性</strong>（一个只有单上游的 PoP，catchment 近似等于该上游能覆盖的用户；200 个对等互联的 PoP 会显著外扩）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"测量-catchment-的实操信号\">测量 catchment 的实操信号</h3><p>工程上常把 catchment 的&quot;半径&quot;抽象成一个加权概率：从探测源 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 命中某实例记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_i \\in \\{0,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，catchment 规模估计为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>C</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{C} = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_i X_i w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该探针的人口/流量权重）。真正要看的不是均值，而是<strong>尾部</strong>：有相当比例的源会命中&quot;次优&quot;实例——这是 AS_PATH 长度与 MED 在跨域下的正常结果，不是故障。</p>\n<p>RIPE NCC 与 APNIC 长期的 Anycast 测量工作反复给出两个结论：一，同一前缀的 catchment 在地理上并不连续，跨国 ISP 常整片落到邻国实例；二，catchment 会随时间漂移，路径变化、收敛、上游策略微调都会让一段流量在两分钟内换站。<strong>因此任何依赖&quot;用户必然落到最近站&quot;的设计假设都是脆弱的。</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"catchment-边界处的状态一致性\">Catchment 边界处的状态一致性</h3><p>catchment 会漂移，直接后果是同一用户的两次连接可能落到不同实例。对<strong>无状态服务</strong>（DNS、缓存前端、视频分片边缘节点）这不是问题；对持有会话状态的服务，就会导致登录态、购物车、WebSocket 连接丢失。由此产生两类手段：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>状态外置</strong>：会话状态放到独立于 Anycast 地址、用单播寻址的后端集群（数据库、KV、会话存储），Anycast 实例变成无状态前哨——这是大规模部署的默认姿态。</li>\n<li><strong>会话亲和</strong>：用一致性哈希把同一会话钉在同一实例——但与 Anycast &quot;任意实例都行&quot;的语义天然冲突，只适合可控客户端场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>QUIC（RFC 9000）的连接迁移允许客户端 IP 变化时保持连接标识，部分缓解切站代价；但注意它解决的是<strong>客户端地址变化</strong>，不是<strong>服务端实例变化</strong>——真正的实例切换仍会断开传输层连接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边缘路由器内部的-ecmp-哈希-极化与流保持\">边缘路由器内部的 ECMP：哈希、极化与流保持</h2><p>流量到达 PoP 边缘后，路由器并不把包平均丢给后端服务器——它用 <strong>ECMP</strong> 把&quot;到同一目的前缀的多条等代价下一跳&quot;组织成一组，再对每个包做一次哈希，选一条。这是 Anycast 分发链的最后一公里，也是最容易被忽略的一层，因为它的失败模式（丢包、乱序、连接重置）往往被误判成网络故障。</p>\n<p>ECMP 的基础是路由器的<strong>等价路径哈希</strong>：取五元组（源 IP、目的 IP、源端口、目的端口、协议号）做哈希，映射到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 条路径之一。其意义在于<strong>流保持（flow stickiness）</strong>：同一个流的所有包五元组相同，永远走同一条路径，不会乱序。若路由器退化到&quot;每包轮询&quot;（per-packet ECMP），同一个流的包被打散到多条路径，因各路径时延不同而产生严重乱序，TCP 会把乱序当丢包，吞吐断崖式下跌。生产网络里 per-packet ECMP 只在极特殊（如纯 MPLS 标签交换、下游能重排序）场景使用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ecmp-分布不均-哈希碰撞与极化\">ECMP 分布不均：哈希碰撞与极化</h3><p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 条等价路径，一个流落到某条的概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个流落到某条路径的流数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 服从二项分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>M</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k)=\\binom{M}{k}p^k(1-p)^{M-k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2723em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma=\\sqrt{Mp(1-p)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 不大时离散度显著：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=8, M=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 时均值 12.5、标准差约 3.3，最大最小路径负载差可超 50%。这意味着<strong>短时间、小流量的 ECMP 天然抖动</strong>，监控必须用足够长的窗口才能看到真实均衡度。常见补救是<strong>加权 ECMP</strong>（按链路带宽比例分配）与<strong>动态流量感知</strong>（如 MPLS entropy label，RFC 6790，用标签自带熵而非仅靠 IP 头）。</p>\n<p>更隐蔽的是 <strong>ECMP 极化（polarization）</strong>：当网络有多层等价路径（骨干 4 条、汇聚 4 条），若每层用<strong>相同哈希输入和相同函数</strong>，同一条流会在每层都选&quot;第 k 条&quot;，最终只用到对角线组合，实际路径从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\times4=16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 4。解法是每层使用不同的哈希种子（hash seed），破坏层间相关性——RFC 2991/2992 的多路径转发模型要求实现者显式处理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"路径失效时的重哈希放大\">路径失效时的重哈希放大</h3><p>ECMP 组里一条路径 down 时，路由器把它的流量重哈希到剩余路径。若用朴素取模（<code>hash % N</code>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 变化会让几乎所有流重新映射，瞬时的乱序和微突发冲击整个 PoP；一致性哈希（resilient hashing）把重映射比例压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，只影响原本落在失效路径上的流。Anycast 场景下这点尤其关键：一个 PoP 的边缘 ECMP 组往往同时承载几条 Anycast 前缀，放大效应会叠加。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[数据包进入] --&gt; B{提取五元组}&#10;  B --&gt; C[带 seed 的哈希函数]&#10;  C --&gt; D[映射到 ECMP 组成员]&#10;  D --&gt; E{路径健康?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[转发到对应服务器组]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[一致性哈希重映射&lt;br/&gt;仅影响 1/N 的流]&#10;  G --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  A[数据包进入] --&gt; B{提取五元组}\n  B --&gt; C[带 seed 的哈希函数]\n  C --&gt; D[映射到 ECMP 组成员]\n  D --&gt; E{路径健康?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[转发到对应服务器组]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[一致性哈希重映射&lt;br/&gt;仅影响 1/N 的流]\n  G --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"前缀长度-bgp-选择与边缘分布的耦合\">前缀长度、BGP 选择与边缘分布的耦合</h2><p>Catchment 的边界由 BGP 决定，而 BGP 的行为直接受<strong>宣告前缀长度</strong>影响。BGP 的最长前缀匹配优先于 AS_PATH 长度：一个 <code>/25</code> 会盖过所有站点的 <code>/24</code>。这既是精细引流的手段，也是 catchment 事故的源头——一个误配的更具体前缀能在几十秒内把整片区域流量吸进单个机房。</p>\n<p>RFC 4786《Operation of Anycast Services》给出了操作纪律，Anycast 工程师应当把它当作硬约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>纪律</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n<th>违反后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>限制更具体前缀的使用</td>\n<td>最长前缀匹配会压倒 AS_PATH</td>\n<td>流量被钉死在单站，故障即黑洞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障时<strong>快速撤销</strong>宣告（withdrawal）</td>\n<td>上游仍保留路由 = 持续黑洞</td>\n<td>故障窗口被 BGP 收敛时间放大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上游侧过滤源宣告</td>\n<td>防止他站/攻击者劫持</td>\n<td>流量被导向不可控节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>站点使用固定、可预测的服务子网</td>\n<td>便于测量与灰度</td>\n<td>catchment 不可观测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意宣告与撤销的时间尺度差异：<strong>宣告可以很慢（几分钟无人察觉），撤销必须很快（秒级）</strong>。Anycast 的故障恢复上限由&quot;源站检测实例死亡 → 撤销 UPDATE → 上游收敛&quot;这条链的总时延决定，因此源站侧必须有探测代理，在健康检查失败时立刻向所有上游撤销宣告——而不是等 BGP hold timer 超时。</p>\n<p>一个常被忽视的耦合点是：<strong>Anycast 让 BGP 收敛的瞬态直接变成用户可见的瞬态</strong>。单播下，一条路径抖动往往被 ECMP 或上游备份吸收；Anycast 下，路径切换意味着用户的包去往一个<strong>不同的物理数据中心</strong>，若新实例没有该用户的状态，就表现为连接重置。这解释了为什么大规模 Anycast 服务普遍采用&quot;无状态前哨 + 单播后端&quot;架构：让 BGP 抖动只影响&quot;谁接包&quot;，不影响&quot;状态在哪&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Anycast 让一个前缀在多个站点同时宣告，选点由三条机制链（宣告、收敛、边缘分发）共同决定，任一条失调都产生用户可见症状。</li>\n<li><strong>Catchment 由 BGP 拓扑决定，不是地理圆</strong>：on-net presence、宣告竞争力、互联多样性共同塑造它；它地理上不连续且随时间漂移，&quot;用户必然落到最近站&quot;的假设不可靠。</li>\n<li><strong>catchment 边界处必须处理状态一致性</strong>：无状态前哨 + 单播后端是主流解法；QUIC 连接迁移缓解客户端地址变化，但不解决服务端实例切换。</li>\n<li><strong>ECMP 是分发链最后一公里</strong>：五元组哈希保证流保持，避免 per-packet 打散导致的乱序；但小流量下分布天然不均（二项分布，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma=\\sqrt{Mp(1-p)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li><strong>ECMP 极化和重哈希放大是两个必防陷阱</strong>：多层等价路径需用不同哈希 seed；路径失效需用一致性哈希把重映射压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>前缀长度直接决定 catchment</strong>：更具体前缀是引流杠杆也是事故源；RFC 4786 要求限制更具体前缀、保证故障快速撤销、上游过滤源宣告。</li>\n<li>实践顺序：先用探测点测 catchment 的尾部而非均值 → 用无状态架构消除会话耦合 → 在边缘用一致性哈希组织 ECMP 组 → 最后才用更具体前缀做灰度引流，并配套秒级撤销机制。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>延伸方向：本文讲清了&quot;包在边缘如何被分散到一个 catchment 内的实例&quot;，而&quot;前缀与 DNS 如何决定 catchment 的边界形状&quot;见同章节的 <a href=\"prefix-announcement-dns-scheduling-method\">前缀宣告、DNS 与 Anycast 联合调度方法</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Anycast 地址模型、catchment 与 ECMP 边缘分布","id":"anycast-地址模型-catchment-与-ecmp-边缘分布"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一个地址、多个实例、控制面收敛到单跳","id":"核心概念-一个地址-多个实例-控制面收敛到单跳"},{"level":2,"text":"Catchment：Anycast 覆盖范围的量化与它的边界","id":"catchment-anycast-覆盖范围的量化与它的边界"},{"level":3,"text":"测量 catchment 的实操信号","id":"测量-catchment-的实操信号"},{"level":3,"text":"Catchment 边界处的状态一致性","id":"catchment-边界处的状态一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"边缘路由器内部的 ECMP：哈希、极化与流保持","id":"边缘路由器内部的-ecmp-哈希-极化与流保持"},{"level":3,"text":"ECMP 分布不均：哈希碰撞与极化","id":"ecmp-分布不均-哈希碰撞与极化"},{"level":3,"text":"路径失效时的重哈希放大","id":"路径失效时的重哈希放大"},{"level":2,"text":"前缀长度、BGP 选择与边缘分布的耦合","id":"前缀长度-bgp-选择与边缘分布的耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"RPKI/ROA、IRR 源认证与泄露劫持防护合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/bgp-interdomain-routing-anycast-peering-edge-traffic-engineering/peering-transit-policy-rpki/rpki-roa-irr-origin-validation"},"next":{"title":"前缀宣告、DNS 与 Anycast 联合调度方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/bgp-interdomain-routing-anycast-peering-edge-traffic-engineering/anycast-traffic-engineering/prefix-announcement-dns-scheduling-method"}}